{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_1","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"遼太祖奮自朔方，太宗繼志述事，以成其業。於是舉渤海，立敬瑭，破重貴，盡致周、秦、兩漢、隋、唐文物之遺餘而居有之。路車法物以隆等威，金符玉璽以布號令。是以傳至九主二百餘年，豈獨以兵革之利，士馬之強哉。文謂之儀，武謂之衛，足以成一代之規模矣。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_2","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"考遼所有輿服、符璽、儀仗，作儀衛志。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_3","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"輿服","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_4","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"自黃帝而降，輿服之制，其來遠矣。禹乘四載作小車，商人得桑根之瑞為大輅，周人加金玉，象飾益備。秦取六國儀物，而分別其用，先王之制，置而弗御。至漢中葉，銳意稽古，然禮文之事，名存實亡，蓋得十一於千百焉。唐之車輅因周、隋遺法，損益可知。而祭服皆青，朝服皆絳，常服用宇文制，以紫、緋、綠、碧分品秩。五代頗以常服代朝服。遼國自太宗入晉之後，皇帝與南班漢官用漢服；太后與北班契丹臣僚用國服，其漢服即五代晉之遺制也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_5","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"考之載籍之可徵者，著輿服篇，冠諸儀衛之首。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_6","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"國輿","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_7","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"契丹故俗，便於鞍馬。隨水草遷徙，則有氈車，任載有大車，婦人乘馬，亦有小車，貴富者加之華飾。禁制疏闊，貴適用而已。帝后加隆，勢固然也。輯其可知著于篇。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_8","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"大輿，柴冊再生儀載神主見之。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_9","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"輿，臘儀見皇帝、皇后升輿、降輿。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_10","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"總纛車，駕以御駝。祭山儀見皇太后升總纛車。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_11","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"車，納后儀見皇后就車。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_12","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"青幰車，二螭頭、蓋部皆飾以銀，駕用駝，公主下嫁以賜之。古者王姬下嫁，車服不繫其夫，下王后一等。此其遺意歟。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_13","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"送終車，車樓純飾以錦，螭頭以銀，下縣鐸，後垂大氈，駕以牛。上載羊一，謂之祭羊，以擬送終之用。亦賜公主。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_14","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"椅，冊皇太后儀，皇帝乘椅，自便殿轝至西便門。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_15","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"鞍馬，祭山儀，皇帝乘馬，侍皇太后行。臘儀，皇帝降輿，祭東畢，乘馬入獵圍。瑟瑟儀，俱乘馬東行，群臣在南，命婦在北。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_16","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"漢輿","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_17","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"太宗皇帝會同元年，晉使馮道劉昫等備車輅法物，上皇帝、皇太后尊號冊禮。自此天子車服昉見於遼。太平中行漢冊禮，乘黃令陳車輅，尚輦奉御陳輿輦。盛唐輦輅，盡在遼廷矣。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_18","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"五輅：周官典輅有五輅。秦亡之後，漢創製。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_19","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"玉輅，祀天、祭地、享宗廟、朝賀、納后用之。青質，玉飾，黃屋，左纛。十二鑾在衡，二鈴在軾。龍輈左建旂，十二斿，皆畫升龍，長曳地。駕蒼龍，金〈夌，土改凶〉，鏤錫，鞶纓十二就。遼國勘箭儀，皇帝乘玉輅至內門。聖宗開泰十年，上升玉輅自內三門入萬壽殿，進七廟御容酒。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_20","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"金輅，饗射、祀還、飲至用之。赤質，金飾，餘如玉輅，色從其質。駕赤騮。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_21","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"象輅，行道用之。黃質，象飾，餘如金輅。駕黃騮。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_22","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"革輅，巡狩、武事用之。白質，革鞔。駕白翰。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_23","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"木輅，田獵用之。黑質，漆飾。駕黑駱。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_24","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"車：制小於輅，小事乘之。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_25","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"耕根車，耕藉用之。青質，蓋三重，餘如玉輅。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_26","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"安車，一名進賢車，臨幸用之。金飾，重輿，曲壁，八鑾在衡，紫油纁朱裏幰，朱絲絡網。駕赤騮，朱鞶纓。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_27","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"四望車，一名明遠車，拜陵，臨弔則用之。金飾，青油纁朱裏通幰。駕牛，餘同安車。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_28","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"涼車，赤質，省方、罷獵用之。赤質，金塗，銀裝。五綵龍鳳織，藤油壁，緋絛，蓮座。駕以橐駝。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_29","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"輦：用人挽，本宮中所乘。唐高宗始制七輦。周官巾車有輦，以人組挽之。太平冊禮，皇帝御輦。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_30","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"大鳳輦，赤質，頂有金鳳，壁畫雲氣金翅。前有軾，下有構欄。絡帶皆繡雲鳳，銀梯。主輦八十人。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_31","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"大芳輦。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_32","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"仙游輦。","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_33","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"小輦，永壽節儀，皇太后乘小輦。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_34","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"芳亭輦，黑質，幕屋緋欄，皆繡雲鳳。朱綠夾窗，花板紅網，兩簾四竿，銀飾梯。主輦百廿人。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_35","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"大玉輦。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_36","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"小玉輦。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_37","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"逍遙輦，常用之。棕屋，赤質，金塗，銀裝，紅絛。輦官十二人，春夏緋衫，秋冬素錦服。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_38","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"平頭輦，常行用之。制如逍遙，無屋。冊承天皇太后儀，皇太后乘平頭輦。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_39","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"步輦，聖宗統和三年，駐蹕土河，乘步輦聽政。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_40","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"羊車，古輦車。赤質，兩壁龜文、鳳翅，緋幰，絡帶、門簾皆繡瑞羊，畫輪。駕以牛，隋易果下馬。童子十八人，服繡。瑞羊輓之。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_41","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"輿：以人肩之，天子用韝絡臂綰。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_42","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"腰輿，前後長竿各二，金銀螭頭，緋繡鳳襴，上施錦褥，別設小床。奉輿十六人。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_43","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"小輿，赤質，青頂，曲柄，緋繡絡帶。制如鳳輦而小，上有御座。奉輿二十四人。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_44","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"皇太子車輅：","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_45","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"金輅，從祀享、正冬大朝、納妃用之。冊皇太子儀，乘黃令陳金輅，皇太子升、降金輅。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_46","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"軺車，五日常朝、享宮臣、出入行道用之。金飾，紫幰朱裏。駕一馬。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_lieu_su_55_47","chapterId":"ch_work_lieu_su_55","textTraditional":"四望車，弔臨用之。金飾，紫油纁通幰。駕一馬。","sentenceOrder":47}],"overrides":{}}